Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
For 2 states and 2 neighbors we find only 4 new behaviors but for 3 states \
and 2 neighbor there are more than 1700 unclassified behaviors.The next \
association should reduce to 1200 rules.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.991536602899159*^9, 3.991536647214148*^9}, {
